{
  "version": 1,
  "items": [
    {
      "id": "c-capital-1-ch01-commodity",
      "vol": 5,
      "work": "capital-1",
      "locator": "第一章第1节：商品首先是外界对象的段落",
      "page": null,
      "page_kind": null,
      "edition": "quanji-23-1972",
      "text": "商品首先是一个外界的对象，一个靠自己的属性来满足人的某种需要的物。",
      "url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/marx/capital/01.htm",
      "errata": [],
      "checked_on": "2026-10-29"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-capital-1-ch01-usevalue",
      "vol": 5,
      "work": "capital-1",
      "locator": "第一章第1节：使用价值与价值的区别",
      "page": null,
      "page_kind": null,
      "edition": "quanji-23-1972",
      "text": "一个物可以是使用价值而不是价值。",
      "url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/marx/capital/01.htm",
      "errata": [],
      "checked_on": "2026-10-29"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-capital-1-ch01-abstract",
      "vol": 5,
      "work": "capital-1",
      "locator": "第一章第2节：生产商品的劳动二重性；一切劳动的第一种考察",
      "page": null,
      "page_kind": null,
      "edition": "quanji-23-1972",
      "text": "……作为相同的或抽象的人类劳动，它形成商品价值。",
      "url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/marx/capital/01.htm",
      "errata": [],
      "checked_on": "2026-10-29"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-capital-1-ch01-concrete",
      "vol": 5,
      "work": "capital-1",
      "locator": "第一章第2节：生产商品的劳动二重性；一切劳动的第二种考察",
      "page": null,
      "page_kind": null,
      "edition": "quanji-23-1972",
      "text": "……作为具体的有用劳动，它生产使用价值。",
      "url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/marx/capital/01.htm",
      "errata": [],
      "checked_on": "2026-10-29"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-capital-1-ch01-social-time",
      "vol": 5,
      "work": "capital-1",
      "locator": "第一章第1节：蒸汽织布机例之后的社会必要劳动时间结论",
      "page": null,
      "page_kind": null,
      "edition": "quanji-23-1972",
      "text": "可见，只是社会必要劳动量，或生产使用价值的社会必要劳动时间，决定该使用价值的价值量。",
      "url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/marx/capital/01.htm",
      "errata": [],
      "checked_on": "2026-10-29"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-capital-1-ch01-value-form",
      "vol": 5,
      "work": "capital-1",
      "locator": "第一章第3节：价值形式或交换价值开头，价值对象性的社会性质",
      "page": null,
      "page_kind": null,
      "edition": "quanji-23-1972",
      "text": "……价值对象性只能在商品同商品的社会关系中表现出来。",
      "url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/marx/capital/01.htm",
      "errata": [],
      "checked_on": "2026-10-29"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-capital-1-ch01-fetish",
      "vol": 5,
      "work": "capital-1",
      "locator": "第一章第4节：商品的拜物教性质及其秘密；物与物关系的虚幻形式",
      "page": null,
      "page_kind": null,
      "edition": "quanji-23-1972",
      "text": "这只是人们自己的一定的社会关系，但它在人们面前采取了物与物的关系的虚幻形式。",
      "url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/marx/capital/01.htm",
      "errata": [],
      "checked_on": "2026-10-29"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-capital-1-ch02-exchange",
      "vol": 5,
      "work": "capital-1",
      "locator": "第二章：交换过程开头，商品所有者的作用",
      "page": null,
      "page_kind": null,
      "edition": "quanji-23-1972",
      "text": "商品不能自己到市场去，不能自己去交换。",
      "url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/marx/capital/02.htm",
      "errata": [],
      "checked_on": "2026-10-29"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-capital-1-ch03-money",
      "vol": 5,
      "work": "capital-1",
      "locator": "第三章第1节：价值尺度；内在价值尺度的表现",
      "page": null,
      "page_kind": null,
      "edition": "quanji-23-1972",
      "text": "货币作为价值尺度，是商品内在的价值尺度即劳动时间的必然表现形式。",
      "url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/marx/capital/03.htm",
      "errata": [],
      "checked_on": "2026-10-29"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-capital-1-ch25-relation",
      "vol": 5,
      "work": "capital-1",
      "locator": "第二十五章：现代殖民理论；威克菲尔德所发现的殖民地生产条件",
      "page": null,
      "page_kind": null,
      "edition": "quanji-23-1972",
      "text": "……资本不是一种物，而是一种以物为媒介的人和人之间的社会关系。",
      "url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/marx/capital/25.htm",
      "errata": [],
      "checked_on": "2026-10-29"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-capital-1-ch04-labour-power",
      "vol": 5,
      "work": "capital-1",
      "locator": "第四章第3节：劳动力的买和卖；劳动力价值的决定",
      "page": null,
      "page_kind": null,
      "edition": "quanji-23-1972",
      "text": "同任何其他商品的价值一样，劳动力的价值也是由生产从而再生产这种特殊物品所必需的劳动时间决定的。",
      "url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/marx/capital/04.htm",
      "errata": [],
      "checked_on": "2026-10-29",
      "en": {
        "text": "By labour-power or capacity for labour is to be understood the aggregate of those mental and physical capabilities existing in a human being, which he exercises whenever he produces a use-value of any description.",
        "url": "https://www.marxists.org/archive/marx/works/1867-c1/ch06.htm",
        "translator": "Samuel Moore、Edward Aveling，1887；恩格斯编辑"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c-capital-1-ch07-surplus-rate",
      "vol": 5,
      "work": "capital-1",
      "locator": "第七章第1节：劳动力的剥削程度；剩余价值率的定义",
      "page": null,
      "page_kind": null,
      "edition": "quanji-23-1972",
      "text": "因此，剩余价值率是劳动力受资本剥削的程度或工人受资本家剥削的程度的准确表现。",
      "url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/marx/capital/07.htm",
      "errata": [],
      "checked_on": "2026-10-29",
      "en": {
        "text": "The rate of surplus-value is therefore an exact expression for the degree of exploitation of labour-power by capital, or of the labourer by the capitalist.",
        "url": "https://www.marxists.org/archive/marx/works/1867-c1/ch09.htm",
        "translator": "Samuel Moore、Edward Aveling，1887；恩格斯编辑"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c-capital-1-ch06-value-transfer",
      "vol": 5,
      "work": "capital-1",
      "locator": "第六章：不变资本和可变资本；生产资料的价值转移",
      "page": null,
      "page_kind": null,
      "edition": "quanji-23-1972",
      "text": "可见，生产资料的价值由于转移到产品上而被保存下来。",
      "url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/marx/capital/06.htm",
      "errata": [],
      "checked_on": "2026-10-29"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-capital-2-ch08-categories",
      "vol": 6,
      "work": "capital-2",
      "locator": "第八章第Ⅰ节：形式区别；批评混同固定/流动与不变/可变两对范畴的段落",
      "page": null,
      "page_kind": null,
      "edition": "wenji-2009",
      "text": "……把固定资本和流动资本的范畴混同于不变资本和可变资本的范畴这一根本错误……",
      "url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/marx-engels2/06/08.htm",
      "errata": [],
      "checked_on": "2026-10-29"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-capital-1-ch08-right",
      "vol": 5,
      "work": "capital-1",
      "locator": "第八章第1节：工作日的界限；双方权利的对抗",
      "page": null,
      "page_kind": null,
      "edition": "quanji-23-1972",
      "text": "在平等的权利之间，力量就起决定作用。",
      "url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/marx/capital/08.htm",
      "errata": [],
      "checked_on": "2026-10-29"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-capital-1-ch10-relative",
      "vol": 5,
      "work": "capital-1",
      "locator": "第十章：相对剩余价值的概念；与延长工作日相区别的定义",
      "page": null,
      "page_kind": null,
      "edition": "quanji-23-1972",
      "text": "……我把通过缩短必要劳动时间、相应地改变工作日的两个组成部分的量的比例而生产的剩余价值，叫做相对剩余价值。",
      "url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/marx/capital/10.htm",
      "errata": [],
      "checked_on": "2026-10-29"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-capital-1-ch23-reserve",
      "vol": 5,
      "work": "capital-1",
      "locator": "第二十三章第3节：相对过剩人口或产业后备军的累进生产",
      "page": null,
      "page_kind": null,
      "edition": "quanji-23-1972",
      "text": "过剩的工人人口形成一支可供支配的产业后备军……",
      "url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/marx/capital/23.htm",
      "errata": [],
      "checked_on": "2026-10-29",
      "en": {
        "text": "industrial reserve army",
        "url": "https://www.marxists.org/archive/marx/works/1867-c1/ch25.htm",
        "translator": "Samuel Moore、Edward Aveling，1887；恩格斯编辑"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c-capital-1-ch24-primitive",
      "vol": 5,
      "work": "capital-1",
      "locator": "第二十四章第1节：原始积累的秘密；生产者与生产资料分离",
      "page": null,
      "page_kind": null,
      "edition": "quanji-23-1972",
      "text": "因此，所谓原始积累只不过是生产者和生产资料分离的历史过程。",
      "url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/marx/capital/24.htm",
      "errata": [],
      "checked_on": "2026-10-29"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-theses-feuerbach-1845-viii",
      "vol": 1,
      "work": "theses-feuerbach",
      "locator": "第八条（1845年马克思稿本）",
      "page": 499,
      "page_kind": "section_start",
      "edition": "wenji-2009",
      "text": "全部社会生活在本质上是实践的。",
      "url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/marx-engels2/01/15.htm",
      "errata": [],
      "checked_on": "2026-10-29"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-theses-feuerbach-1845-vi",
      "vol": 1,
      "work": "theses-feuerbach",
      "locator": "第六条（1845年马克思稿本）；人的本质与现实社会关系",
      "page": 499,
      "page_kind": "section_start",
      "edition": "wenji-2009",
      "text": "但是，人的本质不是单个人所固有的抽象物，在其现实性上，它是一切社会关系的总和。",
      "url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/marx-engels2/01/15.htm",
      "errata": [],
      "checked_on": "2026-10-29"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-theses-feuerbach-1845-xi",
      "vol": 1,
      "work": "theses-feuerbach",
      "locator": "第十一条（1845年马克思稿本）",
      "page": 499,
      "page_kind": "section_start",
      "edition": "wenji-2009",
      "text": "哲学家们只是用不同的方式解释世界，问题在于改变世界。",
      "url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/marx-engels2/01/15.htm",
      "errata": [],
      "checked_on": "2026-10-29"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-theses-feuerbach-1888-xi",
      "vol": 1,
      "work": "theses-feuerbach",
      "locator": "《马克思论费尔巴哈》第十一条（1888年恩格斯整理刊布稿）",
      "page": 503,
      "page_kind": "section_start",
      "edition": "wenji-2009",
      "text": "哲学家们只是用不同的方式解释世界，而问题在于改变世界。",
      "url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/marx-engels2/01/15.htm",
      "errata": [],
      "checked_on": "2026-10-29"
